            <ArticleTitle>Migration and ethnicity, environmental factors important for children's health.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>581-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The consideration of the social environment, living conditions, exposure to environmental hazards, and health behavior provide useful aspects for assessing and improving the health status of children. Migration-related factors, cultural background and ethnicity are important determinants of environmental health.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
